  "content": "<h2>人类村民</h2><h4><strong>需要模组 [EMF] 和 [ETF]：</strong></h4><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[EMF] 实体模型特征（适用于 Forge、Fabric 和 NeoForge）</a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[ETF] 实体纹理特征（适用于 Forge、Fabric 和 NeoForge）</a></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>改变村民的外观，让所有生物群系和所有职业的村民都拥有人类般的外表，并配备全新独特服装，同时力求保持原版风格。</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">主要特点：</span></p><ul>\n<li><strong>增强外观：</strong> 村民现在拥有与玩家相同的头部大小、个性化发型、耳朵、多种眼睛颜色、自由的手和手臂，使动画更自然、更具表现力。</li>\n<li><strong>皮肤重新设计：</strong> 每个生物群系和职业都拥有独特且精致的设计，包含多种变体，确保视觉多样性与游戏世界观一致。</li>\n<li><strong>随生物群系变化的村民：</strong> 增加了许多随生物群系变化的村民，例如蘑菇村民、樱花树村民、恶地村民、森林村民、下界绯红和诡异村民。\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>新的沙漠恶地村民</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>侵蚀恶地村民</li>\n<li>繁茂恶地村民</li>\n<li>岩石恶地村民</li>\n<li>尖峰恶地村民</li>\n<li>旱地村民</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>新的森林村民</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>蘑菇村民</li>\n<li>樱花树村民</li>\n<li>荧光菇村民</li>\n<li>树叶村民</li>\n<li>塞勒姆村民</li>\n<li>天木村民</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>新的下界村民</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>绯红村民</li>\n<li>诡异村民</li>\n<li>恶魂村民</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>新的热带草原村民</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>高原村民</li>\n<li>风袭村民</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>新的沼泽村民</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>红树林村民</li>\n<li>河口村民</li>\n<li>泥潭村民</li>\n<li>荒野村民</li>\n<li>不祥村民</li>\n<li>湿地村民</li>\n<li>苍白花园村民</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li><strong>扩展兼容性：</strong> 包含来自各种模组的许多模组村民，确保与您的自定义世界无缝集成。\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bakery-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">面包店村民商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountiful-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">富饶村民</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/data-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-dark-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">深暗商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/desert-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沙漠村民商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diamond-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">钻石商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易村民</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/end-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末地村民商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/garbage-collector-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">垃圾清理村民</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villagers-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">守卫村民</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">守卫村民商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvester-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">收割者商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/homesteads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">家园</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hunter-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">猎人村民商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">灾厄村民商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-chef-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">灾厄村民厨师</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jungle-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">丛林村民商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/leaf-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">树叶村民商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-dark-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L的深暗商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lush-cave-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁茂洞穴商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monster-hunter-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">怪物猎人村民</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-traders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多村民</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mushroom-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蘑菇村民商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nebulus-trader-for-the-desert\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nebulus沙漠商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nebulus-juice-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nebulus果汁商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-villager-merchant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下界商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下界村民商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ocean-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">海洋商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-ore-traders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">矿石商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pale-garden-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">苍白花园商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plains-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">平原村民商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/railcraft-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">铁路工艺：重生</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">招募</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sawmill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">锯木厂</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/taxbiometrader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">T&L的生物群系商人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trial-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">试炼村民</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-enchanter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民附魔师</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villagersplus-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多村民</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visiting-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">来访村民</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/workers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">工人</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">经验商人</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li><strong>支持模组生物群系：</strong> 集成其他模组中的修改生物群系，并提供新的服装变体。\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">超多生物群系</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">我们走过的生物群系</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版向下移植</a>（苍白花园）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1544973/description_29b0b104-d98b-4ab7-aa1f-23d36987e96d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"422\" height=\"200\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1544973/description_53bab347-4bd7-46db-af01-7d5cc867d086.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"302\" height=\"200\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
